.SH 注意
.\" The old functions are not even available on some non-GNU+Linux systems.
The functions \fBbcmp\fP()  and \fBbcopy\fP()  are obsolete.  Use \fBmemcmp\fP()  and
\fBmemmove\fP()  instead.
